DESCRIPTION:Terminator 2: Judgment Day\n(29.3)\n\nAction\, Thriller\, Scien
 ce-Fiction\n𝟮𝗵𝟭𝟳\n\nFrance\, United States of America\n(Englis
 h\, Spanish)\n𝗗𝗮𝘁𝗲 𝗱𝗲 𝘀𝗼𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗲 : 16 octo
 bre 1991\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿 : James Cameron\n
 𝗦𝗰𝗲𝗻𝗮𝗿𝗶𝗼 : William Wisher\, James Cameron\n𝗣
